{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of strategy, luck, and endless fun in this fast-paced multiplayer board game! Compete against friends or players from around the globe as you buy, upgrade, and dominate unique locations on the board. With quirky characters, hilarious interactions, and unexpected twists, every match is a fresh challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Strategic Gameplay:</strong> Plan your moves carefully, invest wisely, and use your resources to outplay your opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Unique Locations:</strong> Travel across vibrant, hand-crafted boards filled with exciting places to buy and conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd29 <strong>Hilarious Characters:</strong> Choose from a cast of funny, animated characters, each with their own personality and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Multiplayer Mayhem:</strong> Play with up to 6 players online, or invite your friends for a private match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Unpredictable Events:</strong> Experience thrilling surprises with every roll of the dice, from chance cards to game-changing bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re in it for the laughs, the strategy, or the thrill of competition, this game is your ticket to hours of fun. Do you have what it takes to outsmart your rivals and claim victory? The board is waiting!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Win at least 1 game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422060/029ed290bbbfc5626c1e53d4f4c26b225ce9b736.jpg"},{"name":"Win 10 games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422060/c14fa5f35d31a653463a6430e664bff8db33232c.jpg"},{"name":"Win 20 games","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3422060/